Arjuna blocks Narmadā with thousand arms sporting --- Flood sweeps Rāvaṇa flower offering away --- Rāvaṇa sends Śuka Sāraṇa to trace surge --- Scouts report giant damming river amid women --- Rāvaṇa marches to Arjuna pool craving battle --- Rival ministers clash fiercely on riverbank --- Arjuna rises reassuring women wielding mace --- Arjuna fells Prahasta and routs Rākṣasas --- Duelists trade mace blows evenly roaring --- Gods praise as Arjuna repels rescuers bearing bound Rāvaṇa cityward